{"unit_id":"wyq09__dsh-rewind#card-zh","repo":"wyq09/dsh-rewind","commit":"6f1c86c4633e09ded11e3e185c812171759a949f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rewind 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的工作区检查点与文件回退插件。它在 DSH Web 界面加入浮动时间线，并注册 rewind 模型工具和本地 HTTP 接口。插件会在任务开始前记录基线，在文件有变化的 agent 回合结束后创建检查点；用户可以查看时间线与还原差异，再将工作区文件恢复到选定检查点，并撤销或重做恢复操作。它也支持手动快照、多个会话独立时间线以及非 Git 工作区。适合希望在 DSH 编码任务中比较和恢复文件状态的用户。运行需要 Node.js 18 以上及 git、mkdir、tee、cat、rm。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:157-203","dsh/index.js:448-503","dsh/index.js:608-668","client/client.js:204-208"]}
{"unit_id":"wyq09__dsh-rewind#card-en","repo":"wyq09/dsh-rewind","commit":"6f1c86c4633e09ded11e3e185c812171759a949f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rewind adds automatic file checkpoints to the DSH web client. Its timeline previews diffs before restore and supports undo and redo. A model tool can list, preview, restore, or create snapshots. Sessions have separate timelines, including outside Git. Requires Node.js 18+ and git.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:157-203","dsh/index.js:448-503","dsh/index.js:608-668","client/client.js:204-208"]}
